        "params": {
          "text_format": "markdown",
          "width": 1100,
          "height": 210,
          "font_size": 17,
          "text": "**SoapySDR mono FM receiver**  \nChoose your device and station in SoapySDR RX. The 1.2 MS/s graph filters complex I/Q, measures the phase change and records the normalized multiplex.  \nCapture explicitly with `s7hw`, then use the audio conversion in the [FM receiver guide](qrc:/s7studio/help/examples/sdr/FM_RECEIVER.md)."
        }
      }
